  "details": "- CVE-2023-6516: unbounded memory growth in a resolver's cache; every RBTDB\n  node queued for tree pruning allocated an event on the cache's quantum-1\n  database task, so a remote client could make the queue of outstanding\n  pruning events grow without limit.  Tree pruning now runs on a task of its\n  own that drains its whole queue before yielding, and the task is created\n  together with the database so that it survives a cache flush",
